WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Trash and undo. Undo a delete instantly, or restore deleted tasks from the Trash.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: oops; second thoughts.

3
00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:11.890
Delete a task…

4
00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:13.550
…and Undo brings it straight back.

5
00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:15.200
Deleted for real?

6
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.080
It waits in Trash.

7
00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:22.030
Restore puts it back where it was.

8
00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:28.030
A subtask isn't in Trash: Trash lists the parent; restoring it brings the subtasks back.

9
00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:32.530
Instant Undo
